xin","nce-new-1","waiyan9","waiyan11","jijiao1","jijiao2","jijiao9"]},{"text":"num. 一；一个","sources":["self-study_English3","2025KaoYanHongBaoShu","zhongkaohexin","nce-new-1","waiyan9","waiyan11","jijiao1","jijiao2","jijiao9"]},{"text":"num.（数字）一,一个,（基数）一，第一n.一个人,一点钟,一体,独一pron.一个人,任何人,本人，人家,东西adj.某一个的,一体的,一方的","sources":["coca_20000"]},{"text":"一个, 一, 之一, 一体 (adj.); 人 (noun.)","sources":["longman_communication_3000_words"]},{"text":"num.一","sources":["adult self-study examination"]},{"text":"num. (数字)一","sources":["Oxford5000"]},{"text":"n. 一个人, 任何人, 人们(表示与别的对照)某一例〔类〕pro","sources":["Oxford5000"]},{"text":"n. 用于代替表示单个的事或人的名词或名词短语(表示某人的行为令人惊讶或滑稽)你可真行，可了不得一致地；全体；同时(与…)完全一致，融为一体；赞同(…)喜欢(或经常、长于)做某事胜过一筹；强过某人(用于加强语气)我(或你等)就是其中之一占上风； 胜过；占优势一下子明白(或猜到)喝多了集于一身；合为一体几乎可以肯定…(不)会做某事一个接一个地；相继各位；大家；每个人(用于强调)有名的，绝无仅有的， 唯一的(表示强调)就是同一个一个接一个；逐一都差不多；大同小异","sources":["Oxford5000"]},{"text":"adj. 某一个某一同一个惟一的","sources":["Oxford5000"]},{"text":"pron. 一个人；一个（事物）","sources":["2025KaoYanHongBaoShu"]},{"text":"n. 一；一个；一元（钱）","sources":["2025KaoYanHongBaoShu"]},{"text":"adj. 唯一的；一致的；同一的","sources":["2025KaoYanHongBaoShu"]},{"text":"一个","sources":["3000_ClassRoom_English_Words","eflevel5"]},{"text":"a.一个的，某一个的num.一pron.一个(人)","sources":["frequently_used_words01"]},{"text":"num. 一pron. 一个(只)(表示代替可数的东西)","sources":["ielts_disorder","ielts_order"]},{"text":"num. 一；一个；一岁；一点钟","sources":["PTE_WFDgaopinci.json"]},{"text":"n. （One）（印、马、美）温（人名）","sources":["PTE_WFDgaopinci.json"]},{"text":"adj. 唯一的；一的","sources":["PTE_WFDgaopinci.json"]},{"text":"det. 一个（强调某人或某事）；一个（用于比较相似的人或物）；某个（用于不认识的人的名字前）","sources":["PTE_WFDgaopinci.json"]},{"text":"pron. 一个人；任何人，人们（表泛指）；那个人；（特指的）那种人","sources":["PTE_WFDgaopinci.json"]},{"text":"n. 一；一美元纸币","sources":["PTE_WFDgaopinci.json"]},{"text":"pron. 一（个，只…）(pl. ones) num. 一","sources":["gaokao3500"]},{"text":"pron. 一个","sources":["nce1"]},{"text":"（同一群人或物中）一个","sources":["waiyan2"]},{"text":"adv.一","sources":["waiyan3-1"]},{"text":"一, 一个","sources":["eflevel1"]},{"text":"num. 一；一个 n. 一 adj. 一的；唯一的 pron. 一个人；任何人 n. (One)人名；(老)温","sources":["Macmillan7000"]},{"text":"num. 一；一个；一岁；一点钟 pron. 一个人；任何人，人们（表泛指）；那个人；（特指的）那种人 det. 一个（强调某人或某事）；一个（用于比较相似的人或物）；某个（用于不认识的人的名字前） adj. 唯一的；一的 n. 一；一美元纸币 n. (One) （印、马、美）温（人名）","sources":["raz-AA","raz-A","raz-B","raz-C","raz-all"]}],"one ... and the other ...":[{"text":"无","sources":["jijiao11"]}],"one after another":[{"text":"陆续地；一个接一个地","sources":["renjiaogaozhong2"]}],"one another":[{"text":"彼此, 互相","sources":["longman_communication_3000_words"]},{"text":"互相","sources":["Oxford5000","ba2"]},{"text":"彼此，互相","sources":["Macmillan7000"]}],"one benefit of living with older people is that they can take care of children while the parents are at work.":[{"text":"与老年人生活在一起的一个好处是，他们可以在父母工作的时候照顾孩子。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one big part of a child's growing up is to have fun.there will be plenty of time for them to study in the future.":[{"text":"孩子成长的一个重要部分就是开心地玩，将来他们会有足够的时间学习。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one by one":[{"text":"依次地，一个接一个地","sources":["waiyan7"]},{"text":"na. 一个一个；一个一个地","sources":["jijiao12"]}],"one clear consequence of global warming is the fact that there are far more hurricanes and tornadoes in the united states than in the past.":[{"text":"全球变暖的一个明显后果是，美国现在的飓风和龙卷风要比过去多得多。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one day":[{"text":"总有一天","sources":["waiyan2"]},{"text":"（将来）有一天","sources":["waiyan4-2"]}],"one function of museums is preserving works of art that can be hundreds or even thousands of years old.":[{"text":"博物馆的功能之一就是保存那些有几百年甚至几千年历史的艺术品。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one has to persist and should never give up in order to stand out in any field.":[{"text":"一个人想在任何领域中脱颖而出都必须坚持、永不放弃。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one month":[{"text":"1个月","sources":["IELTS9988wangyong"]}],"one of my classmates made fun of my love handles and that was when i decided to lose weight.":[{"text":"我的一个同学取笑了我的腰间赘肉，那时我就决定要减肥了。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of my college friends will come to beijing in a couple of weeks,and i will show him around the city.":[{"text":"我的一个大学时的朋友将在两个星期后到北京来，我会带他到处转转。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of my cousins is crazy about travelling and she has been to dozens of countries over the past 10 years.":[{"text":"我的一个表妹热衷于旅游，过去10年来，她已经去过几十个国家。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of my favourite gifts over the years has been an dslr camera that my dad gave me when i turned 20.":[{"text":"这些年来我最喜欢的礼物之一，就是我20岁时爸爸送给我的单反相机。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of my favourite songs is a lullaby that my mom used to sing to me when she was tucking me in.":[{"text":"我最喜欢的一首歌曲，是我小时候妈妈在我睡前给我唱的摇篮曲。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of my friends has been working from home since three years ago.i really envy her.":[{"text":"我的一个朋友从三年前开始就在家工作了。我真的很羡慕她。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of my goals in life is to travel all over the world.":[{"text":"我人生的目标之一就是环游世界。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of my lifelong goals is to travel the world.in order for that goal to be realized,i'll have to work hard to be wealthy first":[{"text":"我的人生目标之一是周游世界。为了实现这一目标，我必须先努力工作变得富有。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of my worst shopping experiences was when i got ripped off when i was buying a luxury bag.":[{"text":"有一次我买一个名牌包的时候被宰了，那是我最糟糕的购物经历之一。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of the best things about spring is that all the plants come to life again.":[{"text":"春天最美好的事情之一，是所有植物再次苏醒过来。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of the games i used to play as a child was chess.i loved that fact that i could always outwit other kids at this game.":[{"text":"我小时候经常玩的一个游戏是象棋。我特别喜欢在下棋时总能智胜其他孩 子的感觉。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of the librarians that works there is my girlfriend and i guess this is another reason why i dig this place so much.":[{"text":"在那里工作的图书管理员中，有一个是我的女朋友，我想这是我如此喜欢这个地方的另一个原因。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of the most enjoyable experiences i've had was hiking on the great wall when i was only 13.":[{"text":"我曾有过的最愉快的经历之一就是在我只有13岁的时候，在长城上徒步旅行。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of the most important letters i've ever gotten was the admission letter from my university.":[{"text":"我收到的最重要的一封信是我大学的录取通知书。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of the most important things i learned from playing chess is to be patient.":[{"text":"我从下棋中学到的最重要的事情之一就是要有耐心。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of the most memorable advertisements i've seen was one about elephants.":[{"text":"我看过的最令人难忘的广告之一是一则关于大象的广告。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one of ⋯⋯":[{"text":"之一","sources":["waiyan2"]}],"one popular activity among some chinese people on the winter solstice festival is the making and eating of balls of glutinous rice,known as tangyuan in chinese.":[{"text":"在冬至，在一些中国人中很受欢迎的活动是制作和吃糯米团子，在中文里被称为“汤圆”。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one problem is that christmas has become too commercialized and everyone is expected to buy gifts for others.":[{"text":"一个问题是，圣诞节被过于商业化了，每个人都被期待给别人买礼物。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one reason why some people don't consider environmental problems to be serious is that they're not affected by them on a day-to-day basis.":[{"text":"有些人不认为环境问题很严重的一个原因是，他们的日常生活没有受到影响。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one secret i revealed was that i was having a crush on a girl who was sitting right next to me during the game.":[{"text":"我透露过的一个秘密是，我特别喜欢当时玩游戏时坐在我旁边的那个女孩。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one sentence":[{"text":"一个句子","sources":["IELTS9988wangyong"]}],"one thing i like about my job  is that i get to work on a team.it feels satisfying to collaborate with people on a project.":[{"text":"我喜欢我工作的一点是我可以和别人合作。和同事一起努力完成一个项目让我感到非常满足。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one thing on my bucket list is to go to antarctica.":[{"text":"我的遗愿清单上的其中一件事是去南极洲。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one thing we can learn from letters that are hundreds of years old is the kind of lives people used to live.":[{"text":"我们可以从几百年前的信件中学到的一样东西是人们过去的生活方式。","sources":["IELTS-oral-900"]}],"one t